{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/91a31201bd47e2ab16bc9255f71cf0db.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/dfa139901f19a6b16c17ce631c43c010.poster.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/dfa139901f19a6b16c17ce631c43c010.webm?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/dfa139901f19a6b16c17ce631c43c010.mp4?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Godslayer Arena is a roguelike fusion of autobattlers and action-rpgs. The core gameplay loop revolves around drafting spells to synergize with each other, and figuring out where they should be placed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no control once combat begins, and your survival will depend on the strength of the build you have drafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Godslayer Arena is a strategy game focusing on complex and deep spell interactions. Each run will test your understanding of the game's core systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game. Min max your build. Become overpowered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/a57f572401c19d9c0a7b1a1a5e1ad462.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/7de9b9e5d252e8dde299eebd16c94085.poster.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/7de9b9e5d252e8dde299eebd16c94085.webm?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/7de9b9e5d252e8dde299eebd16c94085.mp4?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Before you begin each battle, you\u2019ll be offered a selection of different spells that you can purchase through the spell shop. You\u2019ll then be offered the choice of being able to refresh your shop for more spells, or to gain experience. The more experience you gain the higher your shop level will be, which in turn offers you a better chance of finder higher tier spells. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each spell comes with a set of \u201ctraits\u201d, which grant powerful effects if you equip enough unique spells of the same trait. Holding three of a kind will upgrade your spells to stronger versions of themselves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spells are cast from left to right and interact with each other in various ways, meaning the position of your spells matters a lot. For example, certain spells may fire damaging projectiles, and other support type spells can increase the amount of projectiles fired by those spells if you choose to place them next to each other. There are lots of different spell interactions which include increasing area of effect, granting bonus spellpower, increasing/lowering mana costs, autocasting/combo casting spells, bonuses to basic attacks and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/2e4f7e63ef4129c06569da25bbe30d21.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.poster.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.webm?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.mp4?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mastery cards further enhance your build by offering powerful spells unique to the class that you play as. These cards are only offered once per run and must be chosen carefully. Items provide unique build defining effects, and gems provided your spells powerful modifications.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bloodlord Infernum 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/410f55aabcf8f7da815d1834c9e3286ae1bde821.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Infernum 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/e98e2f3706ae6404f35985fe9489589a54cd99bd.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Twilight 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/c3ed18c33afcdcb8300dfc6fa328f81e8fc14758.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Twilight 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/54b0751ffc005761ac523445f95666461a3747b3.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Frostcraft 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/343b66f285cd954ba8ebba63f4945d0a2f31f3ae.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Frostcraft 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/f5e1815e87c331405a8bf9497d204cc4a60c3acc.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Necroweave 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870430/5e3dc607114bd7d3f4fe74ca78692ad7414fde3f.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlord Necroweave 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta