ul effects if you equip enough unique spells of the same trait. Holding three of a kind will upgrade your spells to stronger versions of themselves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spells are cast from left to right and interact with each other in various ways, meaning the position of your spells matters a lot. For example, certain spells may fire damaging projectiles, and other support type spells can increase the amount of projectiles fired by those spells if you choose to place them next to each other. There are lots of different spell interactions which include increasing area of effect, granting bonus spellpower, increasing/lowering mana costs, autocasting/combo casting spells, bonuses to basic attacks and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/2e4f7e63ef4129c06569da25bbe30d21.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.poster.avif?t=1750093172\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.webm?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870430/extras/72cfa68172007166e9f43dfa908bda54.mp4?t=1750093172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mastery cards further enhance your build by offering powerful spells unique to the class that you play as. These cards are only offered once per run and must be chosen carefully. Items provide unique build defining effects, and gems provided your spells powerful modifications.</p>","developers":["Hippo Rider Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"des